  "setupGuide" : "Connect Google Workspace from this capability row. ASTRA uses its managed Google OAuth client when the app build is provisioned with one; administrators can switch to a custom Google Cloud OAuth client when their organization requires it.\n\nWhat this enables:\n- Gmail remote MCP tools through ASTRA's local gateway\n- Google Drive remote MCP tools through ASTRA's local gateway\n- Google Calendar remote MCP tools through ASTRA's local gateway\n\nASTRA owns OAuth, refresh, policy, and token storage. Provider MCP config must never contain Google access tokens.",
